{
  "id": 1214,
  "description": "I&#039;m only a new player so if you have any suggestions feel free to message me, will start focussing on building the guild buildings after event finishes. Things I have learned being a new player that you may find useful\nPets : Try fill pet slots even if they are the starter pets veiw my pets to better understand.\nLeveling combat : I have camped at bluebell for nearly all my combat and pet levels one reason being the drops sell for ok gold and you don&#039;t use much food ( roughly 8 sharks per 3000 kills) also I join the battle leagues with my 2 alts to gain shards doing this method aswell, all 3 of my accounts are at bluebell hunting, killing and cycling pets. Don&#039;t forget to equip your highest movespeed pet when hunting to increase amount hunted. Don&#039;t level up gear until level 70 plus combat just keep leveling character until you can equip next tier.",
